{"id":"3cfde225-eca6-40b3-8f03-9a468a932c0c","title":"Placement Support Guide","cycle":"Placement Preparation","completion":0.0,"availability":"UNLOCKED","duration":7219,"image":"https://d1tgh8fmlzexmh.cloudfront.net/otg_prod/media/Fellowship_4_0/Fellowship_4.0_Thumbnail_2x.png","outcome":"IBy the conclusion of this course, you will have acquired the indispensable skills and knowledge necessary to thrive in job placements and interviews. You will develop a polished and professional resume, master the nuances of interview etiquette, and garner valuable experience from mock interview exercises. This will not only enhance your self-confidence in presenting yourself to potential employers but also heighten your likelihood of securing the job opportunities you aspire to attain.","why":["Empowering you with the essential tools required for triumph in the competitive job market is the core objective of the placement preparation course. The course endeavors to narrow the divide between academic learning and hands-on implementation through its focus on three fundamental areas: the art of creating impactful resumes, adeptness in interview etiquette, and participation in realistic mock interview simulations."],"topics":[{"id":"20245565-7abc-4c62-a246-18dcd2f335d3","name":"Building a strong Resume","order":1,"locked":false,"units":[{"id":"4262d3a7-c5c6-4f0f-a16d-13f3f0eda9b0","name":"Using Resume Creator","type":"LEARNING_SET","content_type":"DEFAULT","resource_type":"INTERACTIVE_VIDEO","locked":false,"duration":1560,"resources":[{"id":"5fc990af-f5a4-4ceb-81c7-3a9f80df5209","title":"Using Resume Creator","type":"INTERACTIVE_VIDEO","format":"TEXT","language":"ENGLISH","content":"","slides":[],"videos":{"en":{"url":"https://media-content.ccbp.in/ccbp_prod/media/video_content/interview_essentials/english/27-06-2022-usingResumeCreater-English-V2/video.m3u8","template":"https://media-content.ccbp.in/ccbp_prod/media/video_content/interview_essentials/english/27-06-2022-usingResumeCre